- Four genes starts with B
- B \_ \_ \_

=== layout: one-panel

# *Deletion Quiz Question*

@body

- [Step 3\: Note the deletions that contain the first gene]{color=red}
  - Del#1 C, D;
  - Del#2 A, C, D;
  - [Del#3 A, B, C;]{color=#800080}
  - [Hint\: the first gene on the end is gene B.]{color=#B2B2B2}
- B \_ \_ \_

=== layout: one-panel

# *Deletion Quiz Question*

@body

