  - Del#2 A, C, D;
  - [Del#3 A, B, C;]{color=#800080}
  - [Hint\: the first gene on the end is gene B.]{color=#B2B2B2}
- For Deletion #3, we can have either of the following BAC or BCA, so I just write B (AC),
  - because the order of A and C is unknown
