=== layout: one-panel

# *Deletion Quiz Question*

@body

- [Step 5\: only one gene left]{color=red}
  - [Del#1 C, D;]{color=#B2B2B2}
  - [Del#2 A, C, D;]{color=#B2B2B2}
  - [Del#3 A, B, C;]{color=#B2B2B2}
  - [Hint\: the first gene on the end is gene B.]{color=#B2B2B2}
- It should have been obvious that we have one blank and one unassigned gene, so the last blank has to be D
- B A C \_

