=== layout: one-panel

# *Check Your Answer*

@body

- Deletion question can be hard to find the answer.
- But once you have an answer, it is [really easy to check if it is correct]{color=red}!

=== layout: one-panel

# *Deletion Quiz Question*

@body

- [Step 6\: Double check the deletions]{color=red}
  - Del#1 C, D;
  - Del#2 A, C, D;
  - Del#3 A, B, C;
- Answer\:
- B A C D

=== layout: one-panel

# *Deletion Quiz Question*

@body

- [Step 6\: Double check the deletions]{color=red}
  - &#10004; [Del#1 C, D;]{color=orange}
  - Del#2 A, C, D;
  - Del#3 A, B, C;
- Answer\:
- B A [C D]{color=orange}

=== layout: one-panel

# *Deletion Quiz Question*

@body

- [Step 6\: Double check the deletions]{color=red}
  - &#10004; Del#1 C, D;
  - &#10004; [Del#2 A, C, D;]{color=#00A933}
  - Del#3 A, B, C;
- Answer\:
- B [A C D]{color=#00A933}

=== layout: one-panel

# *Deletion Quiz Question*

@body

- [Step 6\: Double check the deletions]{color=red}
  - &#10004; Del#1 C, D;
  - &#10004; Del#2 A, C, D;
  - &#10004; [Del#3 A, B, C;]{color=orange}
- Answer\:
- [B A C]{color=orange} D

